"<br/>\n"
"                                        Our website uses cookies and similar "
"technologies to ensure the site functions correctly, to understand how "
"visitors use it, and, where applicable, to support marketing efforts."
msgstr ""
"<br/>\n"
"                                        Unsere Website verwendet Cookies und "
